 incident timed out. I checked the incident list and found that INC-0001 had been created, so I did not open a duplicate. It is titled \"checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy: rolled back to v2.3.0\" and describes the rollback, the partial failure, and the retry.\n\nFollow-up for the owning team: find out why v2.3.1 fails health checks, and look into the orchestrator error that halted the first rollout before anyone re-releases.", "type": "text"}]}]}